{"2310590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Depths of Insanity", "steam_appid": 2310590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310590/extras/b0468f1732e61c71573cccdc44e7ba49.avif?t=1766926983\" width=617 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Space Marine named Slaug, strangely loses control of his Spacecraft and is forced to crash-land on Planet Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He quickly becomes aware of some WEIRD THINGS HAPPENING IN THE AREA [Or is it just inside his head?]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sinister force is threatening his life and he doesn't even know it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what you must to get that Spacecraft spaceworthy again. Is he just dreaming?<br>What really happened after the crash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person 2.5D Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action with different weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in any direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. Just pure fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of cool Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a House and furnish it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets everywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Songs to find and play in game as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird &amp; Quirky Cozy Fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D First-Person Adventure with exploration and uncovering secrets of the areas surrounding your crash site. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all necessary materials to craft a temporary home and hopefully find a way to rebuild your Spacecraft and return home before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universe is in your hands (head)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Insanity 1 is a delirious fantasy made up in Slaug's head when being knocked out.  <br>Depths of Insanity 2 is just a side story in the same franchise. <br>Depths of Insanity 3 is the Origin Story where everything starts after waking up from a knockout.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310590/extras/b0468f1732e61c71573cccdc44e7ba49.avif?t=1766926983\" width=617 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Space Marine named Slaug, strangely loses control of his Spacecraft and is forced to crash-land on Planet Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He quickly becomes aware of some WEIRD THINGS HAPPENING IN THE AREA [Or is it just inside his head?]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sinister force is threatening his life and he doesn't even know it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what you must to get that Spacecraft spaceworthy again. Is he just dreaming?<br>What really happened after the crash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person 2.5D Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action with different weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in any direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. Just pure fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of cool Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a House and furnish it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets everywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Songs to find and play in game as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird &amp; Quirky Cozy Fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D First-Person Adventure with exploration and uncovering secrets of the areas surrounding your crash site. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all necessary materials to craft a temporary home and hopefully find a way to rebuild your Spacecraft and return home before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universe is in your hands (head)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Insanity 1 is a delirious fantasy made up in Slaug's head when being knocked out.  <br>Depths of Insanity 2 is just a side story in the same franchise. <br>Depths of Insanity 3 is the Origin Story where everything starts after waking up from a knockout.</p>", "short_description": "3D First-Person Adventure with exploration and uncovering secrets of the areas surrounding your crash site.Collect all necessary materials to craft a temporary home and hopefully find a way to rebuild your Spacecraft and return home before it's too late.The Universe is in your hands!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310590/header.jpg?t=1766926983", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766926983", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766926983", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E5-1620 v4 @ 3.50GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1700 MB a